roles-antag-blob-name = Blob
roles-antag-blob-objective = Infect at least 350 station tiles with Blob biomass and survive the crew's resistance.
objective-issuer-blob = Blob Consciousness
objective-condition-blob-infect-title = Overrun the station
objective-condition-blob-infect-description = Infect at least { $count } station tiles with Blob biomass.

blob-briefing = You are a nascent Blob. Expand from your core, accumulate biomass, and grow new structures until at least 350 station tiles are infected by the Blob.
blob-role-greeting-carrier = You are a hidden Blob carrier. You begin the round as an ordinary crew member, but you can rupture manually, wait for awakening, or die to spawn your core.
blob-role-greeting-mouse = You have not fully awakened yet. Your consciousness is trapped inside a Blob carrier mouse. Transform manually, wait 120 seconds, or die to rupture into your core.
blob-role-greeting = You are the Blob. Your core has spawned and your consciousness has been transferred into an overmind form.
blob-centcom-biohazard-announcement = Attention crew. Central Command confirms a level-five biohazard aboard the station. An aggressively expanding hostile organism has been detected. Begin containment, burn back infected sectors, and secure critical systems immediately.
blob-gamma-threshold-announcement = Attention crew. The Blob has already captured { $count } station tiles. Code Gamma is now in effect. All departments are to switch to total containment procedures immediately.
blob-core-destroyed = Your core has been destroyed. The Blob consciousness is collapsing.
blob-core-destroyed-secondary = One of your cores has been destroyed, but part of your consciousness survives in the second core.
blob-round-end-agent-name = blob
blob-round-end-victory = The Blob has overwhelmed the station. It has infected { $count } station tiles.
alerts-blob-biomass-name = Blob Biomass
alerts-blob-biomass-desc = The overmind's current biomass reserve. Higher levels let you build and spawn more.
blob-action-attack-name = Lash Out
blob-action-attack-desc = Orders nearby biomass to strike the selected tile. Cost: 1 biomass.
blob-action-consume-name = Consume Structure
blob-action-consume-desc = Digests one of your Blob structures. Tiles do not refund biomass.
blob-action-place-tile-name = Grow Tile
blob-action-place-tile-desc = Spreads a blob tile near your core or existing biomass. Cost: 5 biomass, x2 in space.
blob-action-upgrade-tile-name = Upgrade Tile
blob-action-upgrade-tile-desc = Upgrades your normal tile into a strong tile, and a strong tile into a reflective tile. Cost: 15 and 15 biomass.
blob-action-place-node-name = Grow Node
blob-action-place-node-desc = Creates a Blob node to extend your network. Cost: 60 biomass.
blob-action-place-factory-name = Grow Factory
blob-action-place-factory-desc = Creates a Blob factory that periodically releases spores. Cost: 60 biomass.
blob-action-place-resource-name = Grow Resource
blob-action-place-resource-desc = Creates a resource node that increases biomass income. Cost: 40 biomass.
blob-action-place-storage-name = Grow Storage
blob-action-place-storage-desc = Creates a Blob storage structure that increases your biomass cap. Cost: 40 biomass.
blob-action-place-launcher-name = Grow Launcher
blob-action-place-launcher-desc = Creates a Blob combat structure that automatically attacks nearby enemies. Cost: 7 biomass.
blob-action-place-cooling-name = Grow Cooling Organ
blob-action-place-cooling-desc = Creates a defensive Blob structure that removes burn damage from nearby biomass. Cost: 5 biomass.
blob-action-spawn-blobbernaut-name = Form Blobbernaut
blob-action-spawn-blobbernaut-desc = Creates a Blobbernaut directly on the targeted Blob factory without destroying it. Cost: 60 biomass.
blob-action-rally-name = Rally Minions
blob-action-rally-desc = Orders your spores and unoccupied minions to move to a target point.
blob-action-upgrade-generation-name = Boost Metabolism
blob-action-upgrade-generation-desc = Spend an evolution point to increase base biomass generation.
blob-action-upgrade-attack-name = Harden Assault
blob-action-upgrade-attack-desc = Spend an evolution point to strengthen the Blob's active attack.
blob-action-upgrade-capacity-name = Expand Reservoir
blob-action-upgrade-capacity-desc = Spend an evolution point to increase the Blob's base biomass cap.
blob-action-split-name = Split Consciousness
blob-action-split-desc = Creates a second core near one of your nodes so the Blob can survive losing a core. Cost: 100 biomass.
blob-action-show-status-name = Swarm Status
blob-action-show-status-desc = Shows the Blob's current biomass and growth pace.
blob-action-change-chemical-name = Change Chemical
blob-action-change-chemical-desc = Opens the Blob reagent selection menu. Changing reagent costs 20 biomass.
blob-mouse-action-name = Rupture
blob-mouse-action-desc = Tear open the carrier and reveal the Blob core immediately.
blob-mouse-awakens = The dormant biomass ruptures outward.
blob-action-invalid-target = You cannot spread there.
blob-action-too-far = That target is too far from your biomass.
blob-action-tile-blocked = There is already Blob biomass there.
blob-action-attack-no-source = None of your biomass can strike that tile.
blob-action-attack-no-target = There is no suitable target on that tile.
blob-action-consume-invalid = There is no suitable owned Blob structure there to consume.
blob-action-upgrade-no-evolution = You do not have any free evolution points.
blob-action-upgrade-insufficient-points = Not enough evolution points. Need: { $cost }, current: { $current }.
blob-action-upgrade-maxed = That upgrade is already at its limit.
blob-action-upgrade-invalid = The target must be your normal or strong Blob tile.
blob-action-insufficient-resources = Not enough biomass. Need: { $cost }, current: { $current }.
blob-action-blobbernaut-no-factory = The target must be one of your Blob factories.
blob-action-storage-locked = Storage requires reservoir branch level { $required }. Current: { $current }.
blob-action-launcher-locked = Launcher requires assault branch level { $required }. Current: { $current }.
blob-action-cooling-locked = Cooling organ requires metabolism branch level { $required }. Current: { $current }.
blob-action-blobbernaut-locked = Blobbernaut requires assault branch level { $required }. Current: { $current }.
blob-action-split-locked = Split consciousness requires reservoir branch level { $required }. Current: { $current }.
blob-action-rally-no-minions = You do not have any free minions to command right now.
blob-action-split-needs-node = A second core can only be grown near one of your nodes.
blob-action-split-limit = Your consciousness is already split enough. You cannot create more cores right now.
blob-action-attack-hit = Your biomass lashes out. Targets hit: { $hits }. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-consume-success = The structure is digested. Biomass refunded: { $refund }. Current biomass: { $current }.
blob-action-rally-success = The swarm receives your order. Minions redirected: { $count }.
blob-action-upgrade-success = The evolution settles in. Points left: { $points }.
blob-action-evolution-gained = The Blob evolves. Evolution points gained: { $points }.
blob-action-status = Biomass: { $current }/{ $max }. Passive: { $passiveIncome } every { $passiveInterval }s. Resource nodes: { $resourceIncome } every { $resourceInterval }s. Chemical: { $chemical }. Cores: { $cores }. Resource nodes built: { $resourceNodes }. Factories: { $factories }. Evolution: { $evolution }. Next threshold: { $next }. Upgrades G/A/C: { $generation }/{ $attack }/{ $capacity }.
blob-action-tile-placed = A new Blob tile has grown. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-shield-placed = The tile has been reinforced. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-reflective-placed = The tile has become reflective. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-node-placed = A Blob node has formed. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-node-too-close = You cannot build a node too close to another one of your nodes.
blob-action-factory-placed = A Blob factory has formed. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-factory-needs-node = A factory must be built near your core or a node.
blob-action-factory-too-close = You cannot build a factory too close to another one of your factories.
blob-action-resource-placed = A resource node has formed. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-resource-needs-node = A resource node must be built near your core or a node.
blob-action-resource-too-close = You cannot build a resource node too close to another one of your resource nodes.
blob-action-storage-placed = A Blob storage has formed. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-storage-needs-node = Storage must be built near your core or a node.
blob-action-storage-too-close = You cannot build storage too close to another one of your storage structures.
blob-action-launcher-placed = A Blob launcher has formed. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-launcher-needs-node = A launcher must be built near your core or a node.
blob-action-launcher-too-close = You cannot build a launcher too close to another one of your launchers.
blob-action-cooling-placed = A Blob cooling organ has formed. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-cooling-needs-node = A cooling organ must be built near your core or a node.
blob-action-cooling-too-close = You cannot build a cooling organ too close to another one of your cooling organs.
blob-action-chew-obstacle = The biomass gnaws through the obstacle. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-blobbernaut-spawned = A Blobbernaut has formed. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-split-created = A second core has formed. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-action-change-chemical-success = Active chemical changed to: { $chemical }. Biomass left: { $left }.
blob-chemical-menu-title = Blob Reagent Selection
blob-chemical-menu-summary = Current reagent: { $current }. Biomass: { $biomass }. Change cost: { $cost }.
