blob-chemical-paralytic-toxins = paralytic toxins
blob-infection-started = You feel alien biomass starting to grow inside you.
blob-ghost-role-core-name = Secondary Blob Core
blob-ghost-role-core-desc = Take control of the Blob's second consciousness and direct a separate front of expansion.
blob-ghost-role-mouse-name = Blob Carrier
blob-ghost-role-mouse-desc = Spawn from the vents as a hidden Blob carrier mouse, infiltrate the station, and rupture at the right moment.
blob-ghost-role-blobbernaut-name = Blobbernaut
blob-ghost-role-blobbernaut-desc = Take control of a heavy Blob warrior and support the swarm's expansion.